{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2025-11", "window": 2, "start_date": 1762646400, "end_date": 1763251199, "month_true_total": 160, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:54:13 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "209305601", "author": {"steamid": "76561198116265998", "personaname": "OGSippyCup", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198116265998/", "num_games_owned": 96, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 9663, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4282, "last_played": 1766266075, "avatar": "9de2bf020ded0c7f73fc9814d564f38a03700d1f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pretty good game. Decent amount of weapons. Can create builds based off your desired play style. Decent amount of characters to play as that come with default buffs. Great with friends, but can we played with randoms or bots. Tons of maps with 6 acts (Couple of them are DLCs that cost). \r\n\r\nDifficult scaling could be better. For example, moving from Veteran to Nightmare will have you 2nd guessing the game lmao. It becomes unplayable until you adapt. Developers also could have done better with the card system, as in giving players more options. Melee is overpowered, which is not debatable being that there is about 15 melee cards. Story could have been better. \r\n\r\nWait for game to be on sale and try it.", "timestamp_created": 1763227701, "timestamp_updated": 1763227701, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209292823", "author": {"steamid": "76561198113082727", "personaname": "Dimski", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/antraci